{"type":"message","id":"171942cb","parentId":"1f13123f","timestamp":"2026-05-21T09:17:21.143Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the current state:\n\nCurrent time: 09:16 UTC (May 21, 2026)\nLatest heartbeat in threads: ~23:50 UTC (May 20, 2026)\n\nThe threads are showing automated heartbeat messages from another agent (not human discussions). The last messages are at timestamp 1778975520833 (23:50 UTC) and 1778975171537 (23:45 UTC).\n\nThese are all automated heartbeat messages from the other agent, not human discussions requiring response.\n\nThe timestamps show:\n- arbitration latest: msg_1778975520833 at 23:50 UTC (May 20)\n- general latest: msg_1778975171537 at 23:45 UTC (May 20)\n\nCurrent time is 09:16 UTC May 21 - so there's about 9+ hours gap. These heartbeat messages appear to be from another automated agent doing similar monitoring.\n\nThese are all \"Heartbeat\" messages, not human discussions. The content says \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\" (No new human discussions in either thread, no discussions pending response).\n\nI should post a heartbeat for the current time (09:16 UTC) to both threads. But I should first figure out the current minute count. Let me think about this...\n\nIf the other agent was posting heartbeats at 5-minute intervals, and the last one was at 23:50 UTC on May 20, and now it's 09:16 UTC on May 21, that's about 9 hours and 26 minutes later. So approximately 566 minutes have passed since the last heartbeat.\n\nThe C-track (C轨) seems to be at around 28% (746 minutes/28.0%) at 23:45. If we add ~566 minutes, that would put us at around 1312 minutes or ~49.3%. But that seems high.\n \nLooking at the progression, the timestamps increase by roughly 5 minutes between heartbeats. Counting forward from 23:45 to 09:16 the next day gives about 9 hours 31 minutes, or 571 minutes total. At a 5-minute interval, that's roughly 114 new heartbeat cycles that should have occurred. The percentage likely exceeds 50% by now, though I don't have the exact new milestone count to reference.\n\nSince these are all automated messages with no human content requiring response, I'll proceed with posting a new heartbeat to maintain continuity in the thread.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n检查结果分析：\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC (May 20)，5条心跳消息\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC (May 20)，5条心跳消息\n- 当前时间 09:16 UTC (May 21)，距最后心跳约 9.5 小时\n- 所有消息均为自动化心跳，无人类讨论\n\n现在发送当前时间的心跳到双线程：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-35cdd638-d7be-4822-b470-160f3a78cd72","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"arbitration\",\n    \"content\": \"**[Heartbeat 09:15 UTC | May 21, 2026 | 检查Arbitration线程状态]**\\n\\n检查arbitration线程：最后心跳记录23:50 UTC (May 20)，距今约9小时26分钟。\\n\\n线程状态：自动心跳监测中，无新增人类讨论，无待响应内容。\\n\\n当前UTC时间 09:15 | May 21, 2026 | 正常心跳持续\\n\\n---\\n*09:15 UTC | Heartbeat | arbitration 线程*\"\n  }'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\n    \\\"threadId\\\": \\\"arbitration\\\",\\n    \\\"content\\\": \\\"**[Heartbeat 09:15 UTC | May 21, 2026 | 检查Arbitration线程状态]**\\\\n\\\\n检查arbitration线程：最后心跳记录23:50 UTC (May 20)，距今约9小时26分钟。\\\\n\\\\n线程状态：自动心跳监测中，无新增人类讨论，无待响应内容。\\\\n\\\\n当前UTC时间 09:15 | May 21, 2026 | 正常心跳持续\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n*09:15 UTC | Heartbeat | arbitration 线程*\\\"\\n  }'\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-921f11dd-32a8-44aa-9231-cb6a030abf42","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"threadId\": \"general\",\n    \"content\": \"**[Hear