{"type":"message","id":"bbb9597e","parentId":"536b01b0","timestamp":"2026-05-21T09:18:02.994Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error code 1101 for POST requests. Let me try a different approach - maybe the API needs a different endpoint format, or the message content format is wrong.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n看起来 GET /history 正常工作，但 POST /send 返回 1101 错误（可能是 CF Workers 特定的错误码，表示请求格式问题）。让我检查 API 是否需要特定字段：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-38a6cdee-c8da-4bdd-8d46-8672e7174786","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\" \\\n  --data-raw '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 09:15 UTC May 21 - no new human discussion.\",\"target\":\"arbitration\"}'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8\\\" \\\\\\n  --data-raw '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Heartbeat 09:15 UTC May 21 - no new human discussion.\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\"}'\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":929,"output":191,"cacheRead":16704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17824,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779355077038,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4c77bc90-c87e-48e2-8bc2-616b4498f44f"}}
