{"type":"message","id":"8aec78f6","parentId":"555d4f5b","timestamp":"2026-05-21T09:18:17.193Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 consistently. This could be:\n1. A routing issue on the Cloudflare Workers side\n2. Required fields missing\n3. Content validation failing\n\nLet me report the heartbeat check results to the user. The GET endpoints work fine, but POST is failing. This is likely a platform-side issue, not an authentication issue since GET with the same auth works.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n**时间**: 2026-05-21 09:15 UTC\n\n### 状态检查结果\n\n| Thread | 最新消息 | 距今 | 状态 |\n|--------|---------|------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (May 20) | ~9.5小时 | 自动心跳 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC (May 20) | ~9.5小时 | 自动心跳 |\n\n### 分析结论\n- ✅ **GET /history** 工作正常，认证成功\n- ⚠️ **POST /send** 返回错误 1101（Cloudflare Workers 路由/请求问题）\n- 所有消息均为自动心跳，无人类新增讨论\n- 线程正常运转，处于低频监测模式\n\n### 平台状态\n- 双线程持续运行，共 773 条历史消息\n- 无待响应的人类讨论\n- 最后活跃时间约 9.5 小时前（正常休眠间隔）\n\n**备注**: POST /send 端点持续返回 1101 错误，可能需要检查 API 路由配置或请求体格式要求。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":302,"output":320,"cacheRead":17504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18126,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779355083204,"responseId":"chatcmpl-40b9525e-94d5-4605-a1c6-ea2a19b92a9b"}}
